        <mxCell id="i24__2" value="The enclosing frame is the top module; the two blocks are its instances. The synchronizer instances u_sync_ack and u_sync_req are inside u_src and u_dst respectively. i_ack enters u_dst; in mode 0 it passes through, in mode 1 it is registered, and in both modes u_dst returns the acknowledge to u_src as the internal net w_ack listed in the DACK row of the interface table." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1" vlsit_library_sha256="D1631ACF98A920526B235E8970FEDDC9305EA2F0D6A35C6529CD220D62AFABB6" vlsit_library_entry="0" vlsit_library_cell="2" vlsit_library_instance="i24">
